# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
@mixin theme {
  accent-color: auto;
}

$size: 1.6px;

.emitted-by-sass {
  width: abs(var(--offset));
  height: round(up, env(safe-area-inset-top), 1px);
  margin: abs(20% - 100px);
  padding: mod(100vw, 7px);
  border-width: hypot(3px, 4em);
  inset: abs(#{$size});
  top: round(1.6PX, 1px);
}

```

